# Never in the image — CLAUDE.md's Security section: "Secrets never enter the repo... never in the
# image." appsettings.Development.json/appsettings.Local.json/.env* hold real local secrets even
# though they're gitignored; a Docker build context is not git, so it needs its own exclusion list.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Build/tooling output — always rebuilt inside the image, never useful to copy in from the host.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
.vs/
.vscode/
.git/
.github/

# Not part of the QuoteDesk.Api image at all.
src/QuoteDesk.Web/
tests/
docs/
tasks/
.claude/

# Test/tooling artifacts.
TestResults/
coverage/
*.trx
evals-report.json

README.md
